\centering\vspace{0.15cm}
{\footnotesize\color{CoverText}
「我的恩典夠你用的，因為我的能力是在人的軟弱上顯得完全。」}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\itshape\color{CoverMuted}
“My grace is sufficient for you, for power is perfected in weakness.”}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\color{CoverAccent} 哥林多後書 12:9 \textperiodcentered\ 2 Corinthians 12:9}
