\vspace{0.16cm}

{\normalsize\bfseries\color{CoverAccent} 關於本書 \textperiodcentered\ About This Book}

\vspace{0.14cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.5in}
\footnotesize\color{CoverText}
本書逐課研讀哥林多後書全書十三章、二十四課，是CCIC Sunnyvale主日學課程的研讀教材，也是保羅最私密的自傳性書信——他如何在患難中經歷神的安慰、在瓦器般的軟弱裏承載莫大的能力。全書整合老弟兄查經法、John MacArthur逐節解經、與G. Campbell Morgan的屬靈分析。

\vspace{0.14cm}
\scriptsize\itshape
A lesson-by-lesson study of all thirteen chapters and twenty-four lessons of 2 Corinthians — Paul's most personal, autobiographical letter, tracing how he experienced God's comfort in affliction and carried surpassing power in earthen vessels.
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.2cm}

